<title>ITALY: Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in June.</title>
<headline>Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergamo airport authority said June cargo traffic totalled 4,895 tonnes compared to 3,741 in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Jan-June cargo traffic totalled 26,730 tonnes compared to 21,777 in Jan-June 1996.</p>
<p>Details of Bergamo aicraft movements included:</p>
<p>Type of flight    June 97  June 96   Yr '97   Yr '96</p>
<p>						 to date  to date</p>
<p>Scheduled		442	186     2598     920</p>
<p>Pax charter	    266	235     1149    1043</p>
<p>Couriers		 630	642     3650    3790</p>
<p>All cargo charter	2	  2	 22	28</p>
<p>Other		     93	 84	705     856</p>
<p>Total large planes  1433     1149     8124    6637</p>
<p>Total small planes   272	544     3141    3428</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
